{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And bring it to me and I will eat it.</b> See, your brother sold you the birthright for the benefit of one meal; and with the benefit of one meal I will restore it to you — for I will give you all authority, as it is written, 'be a master to your brothers.'" "<b>So that my soul may bless you.</b> He said to him: My son, this night is Pesach; the beings on high sing song, the storehouses of dew are opened, and the blessing takes effect because of those who pronounce blessings."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:06:11.726994477Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}